[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5166.79, "timestamp": "01:26:06", "text": "这。我最初想做某事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5169.91, "timestamp": "01:26:09", "text": "像这样。这就是我实际的参考资料。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5172.55, "timestamp": "01:26:12", "text": "所以如果我要做某件事，它就会显示日程安排。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5174.629, "timestamp": "01:26:14", "text": "任何事件。我想把它变成一条流"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5177.709, "timestamp": "01:26:17", "text": "日程安排之类的东西。直播时间表"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5180.47, "timestamp": "01:26:20", "text": "直播日程安排之类的东西。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5182.79, "timestamp": "01:26:22", "text": "我需要找个开发人员来帮我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5184.87, "timestamp": "01:26:24", "text": "有了那个后端。是的，新闻"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5187.03, "timestamp": "01:26:27", "text": "博客里那个东西，还有唱片目录"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5189.43, "timestamp": "01:26:29", "text": "从将来我做音乐的时候，我可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5192.87, "timestamp": "01:26:32", "text": "把它放在这里。电影将包含所有内容"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5196.75, "timestamp": "01:26:36", "text": "YouTube 视频或类似音乐视频"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5204.87, "timestamp": "01:26:44", "text": "嗯，但是，嗯，我刚才想说什么来着？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5208.31, "timestamp": "01:26:48", "text": "比如说，就像安排日程一样，我的意思是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5211.11, "timestamp": "01:26:51", "text": "如果你要去西部地区，请安排好行程。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5213.43, "timestamp": "01:26:53", "text": "如果你像 Face Connect 这样的虚拟主播经纪公司"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5216.709, "timestamp": "01:26:56", "text": "请访问 faceconnect.com 并点击“如果我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5217.95, "timestamp": "01:26:57", "text": "可以找到"}]